1
00:00:00,457 --> 00:00:02,757
(Sheldon:)Whereas, you know,
you say Ditko,

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:05,229
(Sheldon:)and that sounds like
a company that makes Dits.

3
00:00:07,596 --> 00:00:09,536
(Leonard:)That's not helping.

4
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:13,067
(Sheldon:)Well, I'd give more examples,

5
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:16,370
(Sheldon:)but, well, everyone in
your position's so forgettable.

6
00:00:18,941 --> 00:00:21,281
(Howard:)Stuart, we're here.

7
00:00:21,278 --> 00:00:24,148
(Raj:)It's nice of you to let him keep
staying at your mom's house.

8
00:00:24,147 --> 00:00:26,747
(Howard:)Yeah, well, I tried putting him
out on the curb,

9
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,480
(Howard:)but nobody took him.

10
00:00:29,552 --> 00:00:31,252
(Amy:)Hey.

11
00:00:31,254 --> 00:00:33,224
(Stuart:)Just so you know,
the power's out.

12
00:00:33,223 --> 00:00:34,493
(Bernadette:)What happened?

13
00:00:34,491 --> 00:00:36,761
(Stuart:)I called,
they said a transformer blew.

14
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:37,860
(Stuart:)It's the whole block.

15
00:00:37,861 --> 00:00:39,061
(Stuart:)Should be fixed by tomorrow.

16
00:00:39,062 --> 00:00:40,932
(Howard:)Wait, when did it go out?

17
00:00:40,931 --> 00:00:42,361
(Stuart:)In the middle of the night.

18
00:00:42,366 --> 00:00:45,096
(Howard:)Oh, my God.

19
00:00:45,102 --> 00:00:47,332
(Bernadette:)Howie, what's wrong?

20
00:00:50,306 --> 00:00:51,976
(Howard:)It's all defrosting.

21
00:00:51,975 --> 00:00:53,645
(Bernadette:)It's okay. It's just food.

22
00:00:53,643 --> 00:00:56,483
(Howard:)It's not just food.

23
00:00:56,480 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)This is the last food
my mother ever made.

